      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"type-param-R\"><code>R</code> - the target range (or base) type converters created by this factory can convert to;\nfor example <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Number.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Number</code></a> for a set of number subtypes.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"type-param-R\"><code>R</code> - 此工厂创建的用于转换到目标范围（或基础）类型 <code>R</code> 的类型转换器；例如，对于一组数字子类型，可以是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Number.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Number</code></a>。</span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"type-param-S\"><code>S</code> - the source type converters created by this factory can convert from</span>",
